      "message": "chore: renumber all issue references to this repo's freshly seeded tracker\n\nThis repo's issues were seeded from the 67 still-open upstream issues (in\norder) plus the five H-01..H-05 manifest entries, minting new numbers #1-#72.\nEvery in-tree reference now points at the live tracker here:\n\n- 53 xfail reasons across 16 test files (e.g. old #158 -> #65, #146 -> #53);\n  the five previously-unissued ones now cite their real numbers #68-#72 and\n  keep the manifest id, e.g. 'issue #68 (manifest H-01)'.\n- The two seeded-defect noqa comments: hybrid.py #24 -> #6,\n  structural_chunker.py #149 -> #56.\n- The pyproject mypy-baseline note: #155 -> #62, #154 -> #61.\n- CONTRIBUTING's xfail-contract examples (#149 -> #56, #155 -> #62), and its\n  illustrative branch/commit examples now cite real open issues here\n  (#54, #26, #44, #11) instead of numbers from the old tracker.\n\nVerified mechanically: every cited number resolves to an OPEN issue whose\ntitle matches the defect it replaced (renumbered targets carry the exact\nupstream title; H targets carry the manifest title), and no stale old number\nremains anywhere in the tree. All local gates green: ruff/black clean, mypy\nclean, unit suite 375 passed / 53 xfailed / 0 failed.",
